     "bbox": [
      305.28,
      136.44,
      540.36,
      145.08
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Abacus\u2019 is intended for sowing in autumn and winter in the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.92,
      147.24,
      541.08,
      155.88
     ],
     "text": "longer season, wetter areas (600-1000 mm annual rainfall) of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.92,
      158.4,
      540.0,
      165.24
     ],
     "text": "the southern wheat belt. \u2018Abacus\u2019 has been observed to be tol-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.56,
      169.2,
      540.0,
      176.4
     ],
     "text": "erant of acid soil, and shows field resistance to stem, leaf and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.56,
      180.36,
      536.76,
      188.28
     ],
     "text": "stripe rusts (Puccinia graminis, P. recondita and P. striiformis)."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u2018Abacus\u2019 is intended for sowing in autumn and winter in the\nlonger season, wetter areas (600-1000 mm annual rainfall) of\nthe southern wheat belt. \u2018Abacus\u2019 has been observed to be tol-\nerant of acid soil, and shows field resistance to stem, leaf and\nstripe rusts (Puccinia graminis, P. recondita and P. striiformis).",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
